    "paras": [
     "Anolis monteverde is a species of lizard in the family Dactyloidae. The species is endemic to Costa Rica and only known from the Tilarán Mountains, Puntarenas Province, at elevations of 1,545–1,650 m (5,069–5,413 ft) above sea level."
    ]
